# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# pageforge-site — what GitHub sees.
#
# This repo now holds the ONE copy of the converter engine:
#   converter-v2/app/    the product (index.html, js/, css/)
#   converter-v2/data/   the output-shape definitions
#   converter-v2/CLAUDE.md + BUILD_CHANGELOG.md   the operating guide + history
#
# The development harness (reference/, outputs/, the gates, the measurement
# probes) lives OUTSIDE this repo, in ../CONVERTER_V2/, and reaches the engine
# through symlinks. So there is nothing to ignore there — it is simply not here.
#
# The module corpora (01-Finalized_Modules_, 01-Claude_Modules_, 02-All_HTML_Files,
# 00-Other-TK-Resources) sit above this folder and are likewise outside the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- development-only data: present on disk, never committed ----------------
# The engine loads exactly the 18 JSON files listed in Config.DataFiles (the
# runtime loader). These are read only by the measurement/vetting/reference
# tools, so they stay out of the committed engine — the Granular registry
# alone is ~5.5 MB.
#   Interactive_Wrapper_Catalogue.json is reference-only: _modules.json lists it
#   for the dev harness, but Config.DataFiles deliberately does NOT load it at
#   runtime (widget recognition comes from the lexicon + boundary bank, markup
#   from Emit_Templates). So it is dev-only and excluded here.
#   Module_Feature_Index.json (round 271) is the per-module FEATURE index that
#   drives selective regeneration (reference/tests/regen_scope.cjs). It is built
#   from the corpus, ~1.5 MB, must be REBUILT after every intake/regeneration,
#   and Config.DataFiles never loads it — so it is dev-only like the rest here.
converter-v2/data/Granular_Scaffold_Registry.json
converter-v2/data/Module_Feature_Index.json
converter-v2/data/Module_Menu_Scaffold.json
converter-v2/data/Scaffold_Consensus.json
converter-v2/data/Interactive_Wrapper_Catalogue.json
converter-v2/data/Interactive_Boundary_Rules.md
converter-v2/data/Tag_Interpretation_Rules.md
converter-v2/data/Tag_Normalisation_Spec.md

